Here's how you can create a new file in Visual Studio Code for the 2 Sum problem in Java:

1. Open Visual Studio Code on your computer.
2. Navigate to `File` > `New File...`.
3. In the "Save Information" window, type the name of the file (e.g., `2Sum.java`) and select a location to save it.
4. Once you've entered the desired information, click "Create File".

The new file will be created with the following content:
